            "review_title": "Review at Ichihana Sushi Vietnam",
            "review_text": "Thomas S\n9 contributions\n0\nAn unbelievable experience\nJun 2025 • Solo\nHonestly where to start. If you’re fancying a break from traditional Vietnamese food and fancy sushi this is the place to go.\n\nIf you go solo or with a partner there is space to sit in front of the chefs station where you can see the preparation take place. The owner/chef is Vietnamese having spent many years abroad before coming home and is wonderful to speak to. It is clear they are passionate about sushi and takes their product very seriously.\n\nI did wonder why the restaurant was situated in diacritic 3 given the quality of it however the owner explained that rent in district 1 is 3x more expensive which would have left them no choice but to increase prices. For example I chose the ultimate\nBuffet experience at 1,199,000 and the chef explained in district 1 it would be over 2million. They were not willing to sacrifice on proration or food quality to lower the price.\n\nI have never taken to time to write a lengthy review however I couldn’t not write one about this restaurant it was an amazing experience. The price is incredible for what you get and the variety is larger than what I have witnessed in this city.\n\nThe sashimi was so fresh and it was such an enjoyable experience and atmosphere with the chef explaining the dish and the preparation along with the ingredients. (The chef has also created a few unique dishes and snacks such as crispy salmon skin)\n\nI have been to many sushi places and this stands out as the best. Will 100% come back next time I am in Ho Chi Minh.\n\nPs I never really take photos of food and forgot to take photos of the many many other dishes that were served. My photos do not do this place justice\nRead more\nWritten June 26, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
