            "review_text": "Lee_N_76\nEindhoven, The Netherlands309 contributions\n0\nGood but hard to find\nJun 2020 • Solo\nSurprise to find a pretty good sushi place in a small alley. The ambience inside is pretty dark so it's more suitable for dinner than lunch though\nWritten July 20, 2020\nDavid\nWhen the Covid19 pandemic first hit Ho Chi Minh City, we were not allowed to serve guests and sales dropped dramatically and our landlord would not lower the rent, so we had to move to a smaller location. Sorry you had to experience dining in a smaller restaurant because we were trying to survive through the pandemic. Fortunately we had loyal customers from our previous location come to our smaller restaurant because they enjoyed our service. Starting May 2022, we have moved to 69A Duong Cao Thang, P3, Quan3. Now we have a much larger and more luxurious dining location for customers to enjoy.\nRead more\nWritten July 19, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
